# Web Development

## Styling

- TailwindCSS 4.1 with @tailwindcss/vite plugin
- cn() from @repo/ui/lib/utils for conditional classes
- No inline styles
- Design tokens from @repo/ui package

## Forms

- react-hook-form for all forms
- zod (v4 API) for validation schemas
- zodResolver for form validation

```typescript
const schema = z.object({
  email: z.string().email('Email invalido'),
  amount: z.number().positive().max(10000),
});

const { register, handleSubmit, formState: { errors } } = useForm({
  resolver: zodResolver(schema),
});
```

## Data Fetching (React Query)

```typescript
// Query keys in feature constants
const QUERY_KEYS = {
  accounts: ['accounts'] as const,
  account: (id: string) => ['accounts', id] as const,
};

// Custom hook
export function useAccounts() {
  return useQuery({
    queryKey: QUERY_KEYS.accounts,
    queryFn: accountService.getAll,
    staleTime: 5 * 60 * 1000,
  });
}
```

## State (Zustand)

```typescript
interface AuthState {
  user: User | null;
  isAuthenticated: boolean;
  setUser: (user: User) => void;
  logout: () => void;
}

export const useAuthStore = create<AuthState>((set) => ({
  user: null,
  isAuthenticated: false,
  setUser: (user) => set({ user, isAuthenticated: true }),
  logout: () => set({ user: null, isAuthenticated: false }),
}));
```

## Module Federation

Shell imports remotes dynamically, shares: react, react-dom, react-router-dom, zustand

## MFE Rules

- Only Tailwind utility classes
- No global CSS selectors
- Lazy load remotes with Suspense

